      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZINFANDEL TREV (6) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 4.5 lengths at this track in a handy 34.57 beating Weblec Polly. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. MARLI MOO (1) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 4 lengths at Murray Bridge in a handy 39.56. Nicely placed here on the inside and likes the trip. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. HASTY HOLLY (2) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in her handy 37.70 win at Gawler over 643m. Has the ability and can find winning form again. TWITCHING (4) is a last start winner from this box and is in the right race to perform well.",
